{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "latency-not-capacity",
  "title": "Latency is not capacity",
  "summary": "A slow link makes users wait even though nothing is overloaded. More servers do not help; making the slow path rare does.",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "minutes": 4,
  "project": {
    "name": "Latency is not capacity",
    "serverProfile": {
      "os": "linux",
      "cpuCores": 4,
      "cpuGhz": 3.0,
      "ramGb": 16.0,
      "disk": {
        "kind": "ssd",
        "iops": 20000
      },
      "network": {
        "bandwidthMbps": 1000.0,
        "latencyMs": 0.5
      },
      "virtualization": "vm",
      "fdLimit": 65536
    },
    "trafficProfile": {
      "concurrentUsers": 1000,
      "requestsPerSecond": 100.0,
      "readRatio": 0.99,
      "spike": {
        "kind": "none"
      }
    },
    "topology": {
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "client",
          "kind": "client",
          "label": "Users",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 120
          },
          "template": null,
          "settings": {},
          "replicas": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "app",
          "kind": "appServer",
          "label": "App server",
          "position": {
            "x": 260,
            "y": 120
          },
          "template": null,
          "settings": {},
          "replicas": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "db",
          "kind": "database",
          "label": "Database",
          "position": {
            "x": 540,
            "y": 120
          },
          "template": null,
          "settings": {},
          "replicas": 1
        }
      ],
      "edges": [
        {
          "id": "e-client-app",
          "source": "client",
          "target": "app"
        },
        {
          "id": "e-app-db",
          "source": "app",
          "target": "db"
        }
      ]
    },
    "chaos": {
      "faults": [],
      "policy": {
        "timeoutMs": 10000.0,
        "maxRetries": 0,
        "backoffMs": 100.0
      }
    },
    "slo": {
      "p95Ms": 100.0,
      "maxErrorRate": 0.01
    }
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "A fast, quiet system",
      "narration": [
        "The app and its database sit in the same room, so a request takes a few milliseconds. The goal is for 95 percent of requests to finish within 100 milliseconds.",
        "Both servers are mostly idle."
      ],
      "highlight": ["app", "db"],
      "changes": [],
      "play": {
        "mode": "live",
        "durationS": 30.0,
        "speed": 5
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "kind": "meetsTargets",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "bottleneck",
          "node": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The database moves far away",
      "narration": [
        "The database is moved to another region and every trip to it now takes an extra 150 milliseconds.",
        "Nothing is overloaded. Both servers are as idle as before, yet users wait much longer and the target is missed. Slow and saturated are different problems."
      ],
      "highlight": ["db"],
      "changes": [
        {
          "kind": "addFault",
          "fault": {
            "id": "far",
            "target": "e-app-db",
            "kind": {
              "kind": "edgeLatency",
              "extraMs": 150.0
            },
            "startS": 0.0,
            "durationS": 3600.0
          }
        }
      ],
      "play": {
        "mode": "live",
        "durationS": 30.0,
        "speed": 5
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "kind": "meetsTargets",
          "value": false
        },
        {
          "kind": "bottleneck",
          "node": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "p95AboveMs",
          "value": 150
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "More servers do not help",
      "narration": [
        "Add more app servers, as you would for a capacity problem. Each request still has to wait for its own trip to the database.",
        "Capacity adds throughput, not speed. The latency target is still missed."
      ],
      "highlight": ["app"],
      "changes": [
        {
          "kind": "apply",
          "change": {
            "kind": "replicas",
            "node": "app",
            "count": 3
          }
        }
      ],
      "play": {
        "mode": "live",
        "durationS": 30.0,
        "speed": 5
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "kind": "meetsTargets",
          "value": false
        },
        {
          "kind": "bottleneck",
          "node": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "A cache that sometimes misses",
      "narration": [
        "Put a cache next to the app. Reads that hit it skip the slow trip entirely, and 80 percent of them do.",
        "But the 20 percent that miss are still slow, and that is far more than the 5 percent the 95th percentile ignores. The target is still missed."
      ],
      "highlight": ["cache"],
      "changes": [],
      "play": {
        "mode": "live",
        "durationS": 30.0,
        "speed": 5
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "kind": "meetsTargets",
          "value": false
        },
        {
          "kind": "p95AboveMs",
          "value": 100
        }
      ],
      "topology": {
        "nodes": [
          {
            "id": "client",
            "kind": "client",
            "label": "Users",
            "position": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 150
            },
            "template": null,
            "settings": {},
            "replicas": 1
          },
          {
            "id": "app",
            "kind": "appServer",
            "label": "App server",
            "position": {
              "x": 260,
              "y": 150
            },
            "template": null,
            "settings": {},
            "replicas": 1
          },
          {
            "id": "cache",
            "kind": "cache",
            "label": "Cache",
            "position": {
              "x": 560,
              "y": 0
            },
            "template": {
              "id": "redis",
              "version": 2
            },
            "settings": {},
            "replicas": 1
          },
          {
            "id": "db",
            "kind": "database",
            "label": "Database",
            "position": {
              "x": 560,
              "y": 300
            },
            "template": null,
            "settings": {},
            "replicas": 1
          }
        ],
        "edges": [
          {
            "id": "e-client-app",
            "source": "client",
            "target": "app"
          },
          {
            "id": "e-app-cache",
            "source": "app",
            "target": "cache"
          },
          {
            "id": "e-app-db",
            "source": "app",
            "target": "db"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Make the slow path rare",
      "narration": [
        "Raise the hit ratio to 98 percent. Now fewer than 5 percent of requests take the slow trip, so the 95th percentile no longer sees it.",
        "The slow link has not changed at all. Tail latency depends on how often the slow path happens, not just on how slow it is."
      ],
      "highlight": ["cache"],
      "changes": [
        {
          "kind": "apply",
          "change": {
            "kind": "nodeSetting",
            "node": "cache",
            "key": "hit_ratio",
            "value": 0.98
          }
        }
      ],
      "play": {
        "mode": "live",
        "durationS": 30.0,
        "speed": 5
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "kind": "meetsTargets",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "p95BelowMs",
          "value": 100
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
